{
  "duration": 52.44,
  "match": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "Apple set every laptop in its stores to the same awkward angle.",
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 4.4,
      "matched": "12/12"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "Every morning.",
      "start": 4.48,
      "end": 5.52,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "In 2012, Forbes writer Carmine Gallo reported that staff tilted every screen to about seventy degrees.",
      "start": 5.9,
      "end": 12.88,
      "matched": "16/16"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "Not quite closed.",
      "start": 12.96,
      "end": 14.288,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Not quite right.",
      "start": 14.6,
      "end": 15.68,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "Here's the trick.",
      "start": 16.137,
      "end": 16.96,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "The angle bugs you, so you reach out and fix it.",
      "start": 17.333,
      "end": 20.56,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "Now your hands are on it.",
      "start": 20.64,
      "end": 22.32,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "In 2009, researchers Joann Peck and Suzanne Shu found that just touching a product makes people feel like they own it.",
      "start": 22.688,
      "end": 30.133,
      "matched": "21/21"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "And what feels like yours is worth more to you.",
      "start": 30.187,
      "end": 33.12,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "That's why ice cream shops hand you a tasting spoon.",
      "start": 33.253,
      "end": 35.92,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "Why furniture stores let you sit on every sofa.",
      "start": 36.04,
      "end": 38.96,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "So if you sell anything, get it into their hands before you talk price.",
      "start": 39.097,
      "end": 43.56,
      "matched": "14/14"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "Once they've touched it, they're not deciding whether to buy it.",
      "start": 43.6,
      "end": 46.573,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "They're deciding whether to give it back.",
      "start": 46.64,
      "end": 48.8,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "Send this to the friend who keeps his products behind the counter.",
      "start": 48.88,
      "end": 51.84,
      "matched": "12/12"
    }
  ],
